斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/九、北翟（卷四十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"梁绍泰初，突厥强盛，北并契骨，即坚昆矣。唐初曰结骨，亦曰...","context_before":"...之坚昆。《汉纪》：坚昆东去单于庭七千里，南至车师五千里。","source_end_index":80,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f32cbbc8-db6d-5dff-9f5f-6e5dfbfaf132","source_start_index":44,"source_text":"黄龙元年，郅支单于西击乌孙，因北并坚昆，留都之。其后西徙，坚昆复有其地。"}],"path":"山西方舆纪要/九、北翟（卷四十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"乌揭，即呼揭矣]。","context_before":"...为呼揭单于。胡氏曰：呼揭在乌孙之东、匈奴西北，一曰乌揭。","source_end_index":344,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"624b35da-0b41-5e76-a9dd-29fc29347809","source_start_index":316,"source_text":"汉黄龙元年，郅支单于击破乌孙，北并乌揭、坚昆、丁令三国。"},{"context_after":"王莽始建国二年，遣将分道出塞，议穷追匈奴，纳之丁令，即此...","context_before":"...亦作令。宣帝时，丁令往往钞盗匈奴。匈奴发骑击之，无所得。","source_end_index":89,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1651d758-0764-581b-8b07-bdc02f0aaf9d","source_start_index":78,"source_text":"黄龙元年，为郅支所并。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十四、哈密卫（卷六十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"2匈奴呼韓邪單于來朝；二月，歸國。始，郅支單于以爲呼韓邪兵弱，降漢，不能復自還，卽引其衆西，欲攻定右地。又屠耆單于小弟本侍呼韓邪，亦亡之右地，收兩兄餘兵，得數千人，自立爲伊利目單于；道逢郅支，合戰，郅支殺之，幷其兵五萬餘人。郅支聞漢出兵穀助呼韓邪，卽遂留居右地；自度力不能定匈奴，乃益西，近烏孫，欲其幷力，遣使見小昆彌烏就屠。烏就屠殺其使，發八千騎迎郅支。郅支覺其謀，勒兵逢擊烏孫，破之；因北擊烏揭、堅昆、丁令，幷三國。數遣兵擊烏孫，常勝之。堅昆東去單于庭七千里，南至車師五千里，郅支留都之。","content_fanyi":"匈奴呼韩邪单于前来朝见汉宣帝；二月，返回本国。起初，郅支单于认为呼韩邪兵力弱小，已经归降汉朝，不可能再自行返回，于是率领部众向西进发，想要攻取右地。又，屠耆单于的小弟原先侍奉呼韩邪，也逃往右地，收拢两位兄长屠耆单于和闰振单于的余部，得到数千人，自立为伊利目单于；途中遭遇郅支，双方交战，郅支将他杀死，兼并其部众五万余人。郅支听说汉朝出兵出粮援助呼韩邪，便就此留居右地；他估计自己的力量不足以平定匈奴，于是再向西进，靠近乌孙，想与乌孙并力，派使者去见小昆弥乌就屠。乌就屠杀其使者，派出八千骑兵假意迎接郅支。郅支察觉他的计谋，整顿军队迎击乌孙，将其击破；接着向北进攻乌揭、坚昆、丁令，吞并三国。郅支多次派兵攻打乌孙，常常获胜。坚昆东距单于庭七千里，南距车师五千里，郅支留驻该地，建为都城。","content_jianti_auto":"2匈奴呼韩邪单于来朝；二月，归国。始，郅支单于以为呼韩邪兵弱，降汉，不能复自还，即引其众西，欲攻定右地。又屠耆单于小弟本侍呼韩邪，亦亡之右地，收两兄余兵，得数千人，自立为伊利目单于；道逢郅支，合战，郅支杀之，幷其兵五万余人。郅支闻汉出兵谷助呼韩邪，即遂留居右地；自度力不能定匈奴，乃益西，近乌孙，欲其幷力，遣使见小昆弥乌就屠。乌就屠杀其使，发八千骑迎郅支。郅支觉其谋，勒兵逢击乌孙，破之；因北击乌揭、坚昆、丁令，幷三国。数遣兵击乌孙，常胜之。坚昆东去单于庭七千里，南至车师五千里，郅支留都之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2183,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"913f9234-db0e-11ef-a582-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢中","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉中","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb4-db0e-11ef-a88e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"營室曰離宮。閣道，漢中四星，曰天駟；旁一星曰王良。又紫宮後十七星，絕漢，抵營室，曰閣道。孛，蒲內翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"营室曰离宫。阁道，汉中四星，曰天驷；旁一星曰王良。又紫宫后十七星，绝汉，抵营室，曰阁道。孛，蒲内翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb3-db0e-11ef-9c89-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb7-db0e-11ef-9d2e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb8-db0e-11ef-a066-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十五行本「□」作「宮」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十五行本「□」作「宫」；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb6-db0e-11ef-a0c7-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb5-db0e-11ef-98bb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"3三月，有星孛于王良、閣道，入紫微□。","content_fanyi":"三月，有异星于王良、阁道星座出现，进入紫微星座。","content_jianti_auto":"3三月，有星孛于王良、阁道，入紫微□。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2184,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb2-db0e-11ef-91e1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"屬，讀如本字。外屬，猶言外戚也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"属，读如本字。外属，犹言外戚也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"9141dbbb-db0e-11ef-ba5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbbd-db0e-11ef-ab61-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"9141dbbe-db0e-11ef-b882-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢尚書職典樞機，凡諸曹文書衆事皆由之。自是之後，凡受遺輔政皆領尚書事，至東都曰錄尚書事。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉尚书职典枢机，凡诸曹文书众事皆由之。自是之后，凡受遗辅政皆领尚书事，至东都曰录尚书事。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":81,"tongjian_id":"9141dbbc-db0e-11ef-b110-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"臣瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣瓒","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbc0-db0e-11ef-b148-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"臣瓚曰：帝年十八卽位；卽位二十五年，壽四十三。","note_content_jianti_auto":"臣瓒曰：帝年十八即位；即位二十五年，寿四十三。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":97,"tongjian_id":"9141dbbf-db0e-11ef-98a0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"侍中","official_note":"侍中是汉代中枢官职，掌管宫廷诏命和顾问，此处史高担任此职，表示其受皇帝信任，参与禁中事务。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"引外屬侍中樂陵侯史高","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"d4218867-e916-4a78-af78-578c06b9b3ea"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"太子太傅","official_note":"太子太傅是汉代东宫官职，负责教导太子，此处萧望之担任此职，显示其作为太子辅臣的地位。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"太子太傅蕭望之","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"5243e99e-f68c-406b-8713-8252e8cf6660"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"少傅","official_note":"少傅是汉代东宫官职，辅助太子太傅教导太子，此处周堪担任此职，与萧望之同为太子辅臣。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"少傅周堪","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"eb609668-730a-4d33-b06f-f17dc48c8a9e"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"大司馬","official_note":"大司馬是汉代高级军事官职，掌管全国军事，此处史高被任命为此职，作为辅政大臣之一。","official_rank":"正一品","source_snippet":"拜高爲大司馬","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"817e5bfe-5d23-46f5-aa2f-8da7c72f147b"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"車騎將軍","official_note":"車騎將軍是汉代高级将军称号，负责统领车骑部队，此处史高兼任此职，增强其军事权威。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"車騎將軍","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"9f16e8e7-39f6-452f-9144-0eb6aeb624bd"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"前將軍","official_note":"前將軍是汉代将军称号，负责前线军事指挥，此处萧望之被任命为此职，作为辅政大臣之一。","official_rank":"正二品","source_snippet":"望之爲前將軍","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"5d6bbc7f-c07e-4aa6-a5c4-c30613120aa6"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"光祿勳","official_note":"光祿勳是汉代九卿之一，掌管宫殿门户和侍卫，此处萧望之兼任此职，负责宫廷安全。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"光祿勳","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"15fd4bf4-36be-4516-ba6e-844a04f0c81b"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"光祿大夫","official_note":"光祿大夫是汉代散官，负责顾问和议论，此处周堪被任命为此职，作为辅政大臣之一。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"堪爲光祿大夫","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"5218abc7-aa5b-407e-91a9-8700700f5cb3"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"尚書事",