lace_name_jianti_auto":"未央宫","resolved_place_entity_id":782,"start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"9141dbc8-db0e-11ef-8c2f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/单于朝汉","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。元帝竟宁元年正月，又来朝，五月帝崩。故哀帝时，单于愿朝...","context_before":"汉宣帝黄龙元年正月，匈奴单于来朝，二月归国，","source_end_index":27,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5a13c8c5-1094-435c-abe2-0404bc7310ec","source_start_index":22,"source_text":"十二月帝崩"}],"path":"随笔/卷二/单于朝汉","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"容斋随笔/片言解祸","excerpts":[{"context_after":"高祖、文帝之明而受言，元帝之昏而遂非，于是可见。","context_before":"...”帝即赦勃。此二者，可谓至危不容救，而于立谈间见效如此。","source_end_index":355,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f5dd990b-afee-4cf2-a4f5-74398fd5cfdd","source_start_index":245,"source_text":"萧望之受遗辅政，为许、史、恭、显所嫉，奏望之与周堪、刘更生朋党，请“召致廷尉”，元帝不省为下狱也，可其奏。已而悟其非，令出视事。史高言：“上新即位，未以德化闻于天下，而先验师傅，既下九卿大夫狱，宜因决免。”于是免为庶人。"}],"path":"三笔/卷十二/片言解祸","source_name":"容斋随笔"}],"class_tags":["人事","权争"],"content":"4帝寢疾，選大臣可屬者，引外屬侍中樂陵侯史高、太子太傅蕭望之、少傅周堪至禁中，拜高爲大司馬、車騎將軍，望之爲前將軍、光祿勳，堪爲光祿大夫，皆受遺詔輔政，領尚書事。冬，十二月，甲戌，帝崩于未央宮。","content_fanyi":"汉宣帝病重卧床，挑选可以托付后事的大臣，召外戚侍中乐陵侯史高、太子太傅萧望之、少傅周堪到宫中，任命史高为大司马、车骑将军，萧望之为前将军、光禄勋，周堪为光禄大夫，都接受遗诏辅政，兼管尚书事务。冬季，十二月甲戌日，宣帝在未央宫驾崩。","content_jianti_auto":"4帝寝疾，选大臣可属者，引外属侍中乐陵侯史高、太子太傅萧望之、少傅周堪至禁中，拜高为大司马、车骑将军，望之为前将军、光禄勋，堪为光禄大夫，皆受遗诏辅政，领尚书事。冬，十二月，甲戌，帝崩于未央宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，其后望之被谮以死，而天下冤之。夫望之者，固所谓可小知而...","context_before":"","source_end_index":12,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"39482594-52ec-4156-93a8-9b6464425ccb","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"宣帝临终，属辅政于萧望之"}],"title":"一八 萧望之难以大受"}],"id":2185,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9141dbb9-db0e-11ef-8002-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbcb-db0e-11ef-a6f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：有功必賞，有罪必罰。治，直吏翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：有功必赏，有罪必罚。治，直吏翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"9141dbca-db0e-11ef-a058-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbcd-db0e-11ef-97cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：械者，器之總名也。一曰：有盛爲械，無盛爲器。鮮，少也；言少有能及之者。技，渠綺翻。鮮，息淺翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：械者，器之总名也。一曰：有盛为械，无盛为器。鲜，少也；言少有能及之者。技，渠绮翻。鲜，息浅翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"9141dbcc-db0e-11ef-9754-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"李奇","people_name_jianti_auto":"李奇","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd0-db0e-11ef-8d8d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"紂","people_name_jianti_auto":"纣","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd1-db0e-11ef-a9e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周武","people_name_jianti_auto":"周武","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd2-db0e-11ef-a08c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宣帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣帝","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd3-db0e-11ef-9866-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"呼韓邪","people_name_jianti_auto":"呼韩邪","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd4-db0e-11ef-b983-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"郅支","people_name_jianti_auto":"郅支","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd5-db0e-11ef-9f8a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":95,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd6-db0e-11ef-819d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd7-db0e-11ef-9564-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"李奇曰：推亡者，若紂爲無道，天下苦之，有滅亡之形，周武遂推而弊之。固存，譬如鄰國以道蒞民，上下一心，勢必能存，因就而堅固之。今匈奴內自紛爭，宣帝能朝呼韓邪而固存之；走郅支使遠遁，是謂推亡也。師古曰：尚書·仲虺之誥曰：推亡固存，邦乃其昌。言有亡道者則推而滅之，有存道者則輔而固之，王者如此，國乃昌盛。故此贊引之。推，吐雷翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"李奇曰：推亡者，若纣为无道，天下苦之，有灭亡之形，周武遂推而弊之。固存，譬如邻国以道莅民，上下一心，势必能存，因就而坚固之。今匈奴内自纷争，宣帝能朝呼韩邪而固存之；走郅支使远遁，是谓推亡也。师古曰：尚书·仲虺之诰曰：推亡固存，邦乃其昌。言有亡道者则推而灭之，有存道者则辅而固之，王者如此，国乃昌盛。故此赞引之。推，吐雷翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"9141dbcf-db0e-11ef-ae0d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbda-db0e-11ef-afe0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：信，讀曰申，古字通用。一說：恩信及威，並著北夷。余謂前音是。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：信，读曰申，古字通用。一说：恩信及威，并著北夷。余谓前音是。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"9141dbd9-db0e-11ef-b789-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbdc-db0e-11ef-879b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"高宗","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9141dbdd-db0e-11ef-a1f2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宣王","people_name_jianti_auto":"宣王","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"9141dbde-db0e-11ef-8ad7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"殷","place_name_jianti_auto":"殷","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"9141dbdf-db0e-11ef-bddf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe0-db0e-11ef-acb1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：侔等殷之高宗及周之宣王也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：侔等殷之高宗及周之宣王也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":123,"tongjian_id":"9141dbdb-db0e-11ef-8fed-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":32,"link_death_year":92,"link_td_description":"班固，字孟坚，扶风安陵（今陕西咸阳）人，东汉历史学家，《汉书》作者。","link_td_id":"Q10004773","link_td_number_id":12023,"people_name":"班固","people_name_jianti_auto":"班固","people_xingming":"班固","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe1-db0e-11ef-8c4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孝宣","people_name_jianti_auto":"孝宣","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe2-db0e-11ef-9e1e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘病已•刘询]"},{"link_birth_year":-75,"link_death_year":-33,"link_td_description":"汉元帝刘奭，汉朝皇帝，其正式谥号为“孝元皇帝”，后世省略“孝”字称“汉元帝”。汉宣帝长子，生于民间，母恭哀皇后许平君。宣帝死后继位，在位16年（前48年－前33年）。","link_td_id":"Q10000055","link_td_number_id":39433,"people_name":"元","people_name_jianti_auto":"元","people_xingming":"刘奭","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe3-db0e-11ef-896f-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘奭]"},{"link_birth_year":-51,"link_death_year":-7,"link_td_description":"汉成帝刘骜，字太孙。汉朝皇帝，其正式谥号为“孝成皇帝”，后世省略“孝”字称“汉成帝”，汉元帝长子，母孝元皇后王政君（王莽姑母）。","link_td_id":"Q10000056","link_td_number_id":50536,"people_name":"成","people_name_jianti_auto":"成","people_xingming":"刘骜","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe4-db0e-11ef-95ef-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘骜]"},{"people_name":"殷宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"殷宗","people_xingming":"子武丁","start_index":116,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe6-db0e-11ef-b326-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-862,"link_death_year":-782,"link_td_description":"周宣王，姬姓，名静，一作靖。西周第十一代天子，周厉王之子，在位46年。","link_td_id":"Q10000224","link_td_number_id":139086,"people_name":"周宣","people_name_jianti_auto":"周宣","people_xingming":"姬静","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe7-db0e-11ef-9ee1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"匈奴","place_name_jianti_auto":"匈奴","resolved_place_entity_id":104,"start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe5-db0e-11ef-a9de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"汉匈战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0568"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"班固贊曰：孝宣之治，信賞必罰，綜核名實。政事、文學、法理之士，咸精其能。至於技巧、工匠、器械，自元、成間鮮能及之。亦足以知吏稱其職，民安其業也。遭值匈奴乖亂，推亡固存，信威北夷，單于慕義，稽首稱藩。功光祖宗，業垂後嗣，可謂中興，侔德殷宗、周宣矣！","content_fanyi":"班固赞道：汉宣帝治理天下，有功必赏，有罪必罚，综合考核官员的名声与实际。政事、文学、法理方面的人才，无不精通本业。至于技巧、工匠、器械，到了汉元帝、汉成帝时期，也很少有人能比得上。这也足以看出当时官吏各自称职，百姓安居乐业。恰逢匈奴内部混乱，汉宣帝讨伐败亡者，扶助可以保全者，向北方夷狄展示威信，匈奴单于仰慕汉朝德义，叩头称臣，自愿充当藩属。他的功业光耀祖宗，基业留给后代，可以称得上中兴，德行可与殷高宗、周宣王相媲美。","content_jianti_auto":"班固赞曰：孝宣之治，信赏必罚，综核名实。政事、文学、法理之士，咸精其能。至于技巧、工匠、器械，自元、成间鲜能及之。亦足以知吏称其职，民安其业也。遭值匈奴乖乱，推亡固存，信威北夷，单于慕义，稽首称藩。功光祖宗，业垂后嗣，可谓中兴，侔德殷宗、周宣矣！","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2186,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9141dbc9-db0e-11ef-bb16-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蘇林","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏林","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9141dbea-db0e-11ef-8a87-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"上官后","people_name_jianti_auto":"上官后","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9141dbeb-db0e-11ef-9ffd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蘇林曰：上官后。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苏林曰：上官后。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe9-db0e-11ef-800a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"高庙","place_note":"刘邦庙","resolved_place_entity_id":1227,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9141dbec-db0e-11ef-8987-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"5癸巳，太子卽皇帝位，謁高廟，尊皇太后曰太皇太后，皇后曰皇太后。","content_fanyi":"癸巳日，皇太子刘奭即皇帝位，拜谒汉高祖庙，尊奉皇太后为太皇太后，尊奉皇后为皇太后。","content_jianti_auto":"5癸巳，太子即皇帝位，谒高庙，尊皇太后曰太皇太后，皇后曰皇太后。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2187,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9141dbe8-db0e-11ef-9c42-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"黃龍元年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"黄龙元年","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"913f922f-db0e-11ef-b7b7-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（壬申、前四九）","year_int":-49},"message":"success","success":true}